{"id": "1ba9c559-c779-45f8-a7c0-cfb083343523", "slug": "architecture-flow-remixed", "title": "Architecture Flow - Remixed", "description": "Architecture Flow Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Architecture Flow - Remixed\"\ndescription: \"Architecture Flow Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#F1F5F9\"\n  accent: \"#22D3EE\"\n  background: \"#F1F5F9\"\n  surface: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Roboto Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Roboto Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Architecture Flow - Remixed\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 1; remixes: 1.\nTags: login, animated, webgl, threejs, security, input, validation, effect.\n## Overview\nArchitecture Flow Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nTRIGGER Validate Identity / 001 Each request passes through rigorous security checks against defined organizational policies, guaranteeing that only fully verified users can trigger subsequent automated workflows. AUTH-…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Validate Identity; Suspend Process; Enforce Limits.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #F1F5F9, accent #22D3EE, background #F1F5F9, surface #CBD5E1, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Roboto Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Roboto Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Architecture Flow - Remixed</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-neutral-900 overflow-x-hidden m-0 p-0 antialiased font-['Inter',sans-serif]\" style=\"background-color: #020617; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 80px 80px; background-position: center center;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-30\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 lg:p-12 w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-center w-full max-w-[1400px]\">\n\n            <!-- Left Label: TRIGGER -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center mb-12 lg:mb-0 lg:mr-4 shrink-0 z-20\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#f1f5f9] text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 90% 0%, 100% 50%, 90% 100%, 0% 100%); padding-right: 1.5rem;\">\n                    TRIGGER\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Left Connecting Lines (Hidden on mobile for clarity, visible on lg) -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:block relative w-[120px] h-[300px] shrink-0 z-10\">\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 300\" fill=\"none\" class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 50, 120 50\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 90, 120 90\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 130, 120 130\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 170, 120 170\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 210, 120 210\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 150 C 60 150, 60 250, 120 250\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Cards Container -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-stretch gap-4 lg:gap-2 z-20\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Cyan -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[320px] bg-[#22d3ee] flex flex-col p-6 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline mb-6 border-b border-neutral-900/10 pb-2\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Validate Identity</h2>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] opacity-70\">/ 001</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Illustration Box -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] mb-6 relative flex items-center justify-center border border-neutral-900/20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 8px);\">\n                        <!-- Corner brackets -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-neutral-900\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-neutral-900\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-neutral-900\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-neutral-900\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- SVG Graphic -->\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" class=\"relative z-10 text-neutral-900\">\n                            <!-- Isometric blocks approx -->\n                            <path d=\"M 30 60 L 50 70 L 50 90 L 30 80 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 50 70 L 70 60 L 70 80 L 50 90 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 30 60 L 50 50 L 70 60 L 50 70 Z\" />\n\n                            <path d=\"M 10 40 L 25 47 L 25 62 L 10 55 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 25 47 L 40 40 L 40 55 L 25 62 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 10 40 L 25 33 L 40 40 L 25 47 Z\" />\n\n                            <path d=\"M 60 30 L 75 37 L 75 52 L 60 45 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 75 37 L 90 30 L 90 45 L 75 52 Z\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 60 30 L 75 23 L 90 30 L 75 37 Z\" />\n\n                            <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"45\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#22d3ee\" stroke=\"currentColor\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 45 45 L 49 49 L 57 41\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] leading-relaxed mb-12 flex-grow masked-reveal\">\n                        Each request passes through rigorous security checks against defined organizational policies, guaranteeing that only fully verified users can trigger subsequent automated workflows.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] uppercase tracking-wider opacity-60 mt-auto\">\n                        AUTH-LAYER · 0.1MS\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Slate -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[320px] bg-[#f1f5f9] flex flex-col p-6 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline mb-6 border-b border-neutral-900/10 pb-2\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Suspend Process</h2>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] opacity-50\">/ 002</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] mb-6 relative flex items-center justify-center border border-neutral-900/20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 8px);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" class=\"relative z-10 text-neutral-800\">\n                            <!-- Isometric Button Base -->\n                            <path d=\"M 20 60 L 50 75 L 80 60 L 80 70 L 50 85 L 20 70 Z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 20 60 L 50 45 L 80 60 L 50 75 Z\" />\n                            <!-- Button Top -->\n                            <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"7\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 35 35 L 35 45 A 15 7 0 0 0 65 45 L 65 35\" />\n                            <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 38 30 L 38 35 A 12 5 0 0 0 62 35 L 62 30\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] leading-relaxed mb-12 flex-grow masked-reveal\">\n                        Workloads can be immediately frozen while retaining their exact state. This grants operators complete visibility into the event timeline to troubleshoot and safely restore normal functions.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] uppercase tracking-wider opacity-40 mt-auto\">\n                        QUEUE-BUS · 0.3MS\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Slate -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[320px] bg-[#f1f5f9] flex flex-col p-6 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline mb-6 border-b border-neutral-900/10 pb-2\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Enforce Limits</h2>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] opacity-50\">/ 003</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] mb-6 relative flex items-center justify-center border border-neutral-900/20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 8px);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 left-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 right-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-neutral-900/50\"></div>\n\n                        <svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" class=\"relative z-10 text-neutral-800\">\n                            <!-- Isometric Funnel -->\n                            <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"30\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"10\" />\n                            <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" rx=\"32\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 18 35 C 18 60, 40 70, 40 80 L 60 80 C 60 70, 82 60, 82 35\" />\n                            <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"3\" />\n                            <!-- Floating shapes inside -->\n                            <path d=\"M 40 25 L 50 15 L 60 25 L 50 35 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" />\n                            <path d=\"M 65 30 L 75 25 L 75 35 Z\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" />\n                            <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"0.7\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] leading-relaxed mb-12 flex-grow masked-reveal\">\n                        Dynamically adjust bandwidth and compute quotas in real-time. Gain precise control over traffic distribution to maintain high performance even during unexpected usage spikes.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] uppercase tracking-wider opacity-40 mt-auto\">\n                        GATEWAY · 0.2MS\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Connecting Lines -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:block relative w-[120px] h-[300px] shrink-0 z-10\">\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 300\" fill=\"none\" class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                    <path d=\"M 0 50 C 60 50, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 90 C 60 90, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 130 C 60 130, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 170 C 60 170, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 210 C 60 210, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M 0 250 C 60 250, 60 150, 120 150\" stroke=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" class=\"flow-line-out\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Label: ROUTE -->\n            <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center mt-12 lg:mt-0 lg:ml-4 shrink-0 z-20\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#f1f5f9] text-xs font-['Roboto_Mono',monospace] px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(10% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 10% 100%, 0% 50%); padding-left: 1.5rem;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    ROUTE\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Masked Reveal for text\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.masked-reveal');\n\n            revealElements.forEach(element => {\n                const text = element.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                element.innerHTML = ''; // clear original text\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    // Outer span (mask)\n                    const outerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    outerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    outerSpan.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    outerSpan.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n\n                    // Inner span (animated text)\n                    const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                    innerSpan.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    innerSpan.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)'; // initial state\n                    innerSpan.innerText = word + '\\u00A0'; // add non-breaking space\n                    innerSpan.classList.add('word-inner');\n\n                    outerSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n                    element.appendChild(outerSpan);\n                });\n\n                // Animate inner spans\n                const innerWords = element.querySelectorAll('.word-inner');\n                gsap.to(innerWords, {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 0.6,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    stagger: 0.015,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: element,\n                        start: \"top 90%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Animate SVG flow lines\n            gsap.fromTo('.flow-line',\n                { strokeDasharray: \"10 20\", strokeDashoffset: 100 },\n                { strokeDashoffset: 0, duration: 4, repeat: -1, ease: \"linear\" }\n            );\n            gsap.fromTo('.flow-line-out',\n                { strokeDasharray: \"10 20\", strokeDashoffset: 100 },\n                { strokeDashoffset: 0, duration: 4, repeat: -1, ease: \"linear\" }\n            );\n        });\n\n        // Three.js Subtle WebGL Background Animation\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 30;\n            camera.position.y = 10;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create a subtle wireframe terrain/grid\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(200, 200, 40, 40);\n\n            // Displace vertices slightly to create a wavy effect\n            const positions = geometry.attributes.position;\n            for (let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                const x = positions.getX(i);\n                const y = positions.getY(i);\n                // Create a smooth wave pattern based on x and y\n                const z = Math.sin(x * 0.1) * 2 + Math.cos(y * 0.1) * 2;\n                positions.setZ(i, z);\n            }\n\n            geometry.computeVertexNormals();\n\n            // Updated color to match the new cyan/slate palette\n            const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x0ea5e9,\n                wireframe: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15\n            });\n\n            const plane = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            plane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2.5; // Tilt it back\n            scene.add(plane);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let time = 0;\n            const animate = function () {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                time += 0.002;\n\n                // Slowly rotate the plane\n                plane.rotation.z = time * 0.5;\n\n                // Optional: Animate vertices dynamically for a flowing effect\n                const positions = plane.geometry.attributes.position;\n                for (let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                    const x = positions.getX(i);\n                    const y = positions.getY(i);\n                    const z = Math.sin(x * 0.1 + time * 5) * 2 + Math.cos(y * 0.1 + time * 3) * 2;\n                    positions.setZ(i, z);\n                }\n                plane.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after load\n        window.onload = initWebGL;\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "architecture-flow-remixed.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/architecture-flow-remixed.jpg", "source_name": "architecture-flow-remixed-DESIGN.md", "views": 38, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:50:38.08452+00:00"}